e from bottom, for <italic>13.0</italic> read <italic>17.8</italic>. 6th line from bottom, for <italic>29</italic> read <italic>40</italic>. Page 890, 3rd line from the top, for <italic>12.5</italic> read <italic>13.3</italic>. 4th line from the top, for "<italic>This value, approximately 34 per cent of the total circulating serum protein, agrees very well with those recorded for dogs 3 and 4</italic>," read "<italic>This value is approximately 36 per cent of the total circulating serum protein. During the initial depletion week, 38.0 gm. of serum protein were removed from this animal</italic>." 20th line from top, for <italic>30 to 40</italic> read <italic>35 to 55</italic>. Page 895, 2nd line in 3rd paragraph under Summary, for <italic>30 to 40</italic> read <italic>35 to 55</italic>. </p></abstract></article-meta></front></article>